<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat steady in bearish market.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat steady in bearish market.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian wheat futures traded in a subdued holding pattern on Thursday.</p>
<p>January 1997 rose by 50 cents to A$148.00 a tonne on five trades.</p>
<p>The market remained &quot;pretty much unchanged&quot; and continued to track Chicago, said Kerrin Gleeson of Elders Risk Management. &quot;There doesn't seem to be any sign of it turning,&quot; she said. &quot;We're still pretty much in a downward trend.&quot;  </p>
